[Nespresso Terrasse - Montreux Jazz Festival]
[INVITATION]
PERSONAL
MONTREUX JAZZ FESTIVAL

Dear =ABFirst_Name=BB,

As a proud partner of the Montreux Jazz Festival,
we are delighted to invite you to a special VIP evening
on the Nespresso Terrasse.

Thursday July 9th at 17:00

Join us for the concerts of

JOY CROOKES & JOHN LEGEND

and immerse yourself in a unique summer experience
overlooking the lake.

We would love to welcome you for a cocktail dinner
and a curated journey through our Pool Universe,
a moment to connect, discover, and enjoy the festival
in true Nespresso style.

Full details of the evening will follow shortly.

Please confirm your attendance below.

We look forward to sharing this moment with you.

Best regards,
=ABSender_Name=BB

CONFIRM YOUR ATTENDANCE<https://nespresso-mjf.trivialmass.com/invitation_z_=
july_9>
[Nespresso - Pool Universe]


--_000_GVAP278MB00065EB66A924B197126FDBDBB1C2GVAP278MB0006CHEP_
